### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser1",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Obtener perfil de usuario (requiere token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Obtener scoreboard (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/scoreboard

### Obtener scoreboard con paginación
GET {{baseUrl}}/scoreboard?limit=5&page=1

### Obtener estadísticas del usuario (requiere token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/scoreboard/my-stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar puntuación (requiere token)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/scoreboard/update-score
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "score": 100
}

### Actualizar racha diaria (requiere token)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/scoreboard/update-streak
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "dailyStreak": 3
}

### Actualizar estadísticas (requiere token)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/scoreboard/update-stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "score": 250,
    "dailyStreak": 5
}

### Obtener usuario por nombre de usuario (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/scoreboard/user/testuser1

### Cambiar contraseña (requiere token)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "currentPassword": "password123",
    "newPassword": "newpassword456"
}

### Verificar token (requiere token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Refrescar token (requiere token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
